    "description": "In this study, the petrographic characteristics and distribution of volcanic\nrocks of  the superior cenozoic in the South Shetland Islands are discussed.\nThe geology of the Coppermine Peninsula, on Robert Island, Potter Peninsula on\nKing George Island, Bridgeman Island, Penguin Island and Deception Island is\ndetailed . The evolution of the pleistocene-recent volcanic centers bound to\nthe tectonic depression of the Bransfield Strait and the recent eruptions on\nDeception Island are analyzed.\n\nEn Espanol:\nEn este trabajo se discuten las caracteristicas petrograficas y distribucion de\nlas rocas volcanicas del cenozoico superior en las Islas Shetland del Sur,\nAntartica. Se detalla la geologia de Peninsula Copper Mine, Isla Robert, Potter\nen Isla Rey Jorge, Bridgeman, Penguin y Decepcion. Se analiza la evolucion de\nlos centros volcanicos pleistocenico-recientes ligada a la depresion tectonica\ndel Estrecho de Bransfield y las recientes erupciones ocurridas en Isla\nDecepcion.",
